      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To synthesize plain text to an audio byte stream, I will use the Amazon Polly service, which is a text-to-speech service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. I will import the necessary modules from the boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with the Amazon Polly service. The code will include the provider-specific client class and the provider-specific model ID to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
